<Layout
  title="Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash - A.I. - Rycode"
  description="Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash is Google’s generally available video model, released 5 November 2026, for clips up to 15 seconds with audio at about $0.07 a second for 720p."
